9d86b3ee025e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1aca3f31ba663daf36b6f2c08e19b2b5f3505613b394e5b3d3f3057c83116079","logical_entry_identity":"ba323717f41f58a4cd3029dabab6441912ad3f84f07a665c3866dc165dd96218","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"TOO SLOW, HAMBRAIN. ELIXIR'S MADE ALREADY, AND SOMEBODY ELSE WALKED OFF WITH THE REWARD. IF YOU'RE FEELING SORRY FOR YOURSELF, ASK WHETHER THIS IS MORE OR LESS PLEASANT THAN GETTING APPRECIABLE CHUNKS OF YOUR ANATOMY BLASTED CLEAN OFF YOUR BODY THIS MORNING. THAT'S RIGHT. BYE.","source_tag":"_t","target":"太慢了，蠢蛋，药剂我已经做好了。已经有人来拿走了奖励。如果你觉得委屈，就问问自己：这比今天早上被从身上整块整块地炸飞，是更愉快还是更不愉快。没错。再见。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a887df4b491d865e04a3e957dc716f6a9e55872420f96911b20b0de815414151","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1acb429258bb7d9188a029cd0d8d5f5f79322281b97c99dc0630e52e5a6123b9","logical_entry_identity":"82e877b1866a2e0aec20fc77fa0877150e23c19d71c37a40c406014aeb41b94a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"50% chance to reload 1 ammo","source_tag":"_t","target":"50% 几率装填1发弹药"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"385894c6f6dad009260598879ed88242169caba6747e7df88637dfafa429da72","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1acf204b514fa6d0c1956050f5f91ddc7b910e3900fbf74ea67b18db95cbffc9","logical_entry_identity":"f0c30c2c6d7937efb13f8745d59b78c0bef8ff509076e04a4d5d9b0a868235dc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Know how to either prepare traps or apply poisons","source_tag":"_t","target":"掌握陷阱或者毒药技能"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"23585d6eda4478a8e4e803a98caa68bc535504dcd53d1f2178efe979d0206b54","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1acfe8885f8ea70709446b368304cf8dde39ec1d02e533d54afe504c86d72f04","logical_entry_identity":"00b9c873d3d26594e78389327e1f6d46b66c166c3b14f8f013b32328fe12d93a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"vile life","source_tag":"talent type","target":"邪恶生命"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a290de32543c8a31700d0009e63e4d5e509b2b7fcffa7d426acb7abedaf29a5c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1ad20269f4251393118c2db5e2184d1eb66c9ea70d3f86deef06269c6a026fec","logical_entry_identity":"b022d9c21347572251fd0a47994bf085e89d9049f7d7c60448f31e8dd6a1c6b7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The code of the Sun Paladins can be a heavy burden.\t Wouldn't you like to let go?\n\t\t#{italic}##GREY#To give in to the darkness?#LAST##{normal}#\n\t\t\n\t\t#CRIMSON#This evolution fundamentally alters your class and character in a huge way. Do not take it lightly.#LAST#\n\n\t\tAny offensive combat techniques or unlockable Celestial talent trees you know will be exchanged for cursed versions, allowing you to cut a bloody trail through enemies, turning your radiance to gloom, and more while also gaining new combat styles and defenses.\n\n\t\tThe following talent trees are swapped:\n\t\t- #GOLD#Radiance#LAST# turns into #CRIMSON#Gloom#LAST#: Project onto others your own hate, hindering them\n\t\t- #GOLD#Guardian#LAST# turns into #CRIMSON#Crimson Templar#LAST#: Use the power of blood to control and defeat the fools that oppose you\n\t\t- #GOLD#Crusader#LAST# turns into #CRIMSON#Dark Sun#LAST#: Call upon the energies of dead suns to crush your foes\n\n\t\tYou will learn the following talents trees:\n\t\t- #CRIMSON#Bloodstained#LAST#: Make your foes bleed!\n\t\t- #CRIMSON#Darkside#LAST#: Every light casts a shadow, yours is powerful indeed\n\t\t- #CRIMSON#Hatred#LAST#: Manifest your hatred through bleeding\n\t\t- #CRIMSON#Dirge#LAST#: Sing of death and sorrow to strengthen your resolve\n\n\t\tYou will forget the following talent trees, refunding any talent points: Shield Offense, Two-handed Assault.\n\t\tAlso the cost of any talents of the Combat Techniques tree will be converted to hate instead of stamina.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"太阳骑士的行动守则也是一个重担。你有没有想过将其抛弃？\n\t\t#{italic}##GREY#并投身黑暗？#LAST##{normal}#\n\n\t\t#CRIMSON#此进阶会完全颠覆你的职业并大幅度改变你的人物。不要轻易选择。#LAST#\n\n\t\t你所知的所有攻击性格斗系或可解锁的天空系技能树都会被替换为诅咒的版本，使你能够一边散发着黑暗的光辉一边在敌军中杀出一条血路，并且获得新的战斗风格和防御能力。\n\n\t\t以下技能树将被替换：\n\t\t- #GOLD#光辉#LAST#变为#CRIMSON#黑暗光环#LAST#：将你的憎恨投射到他人身上以阻碍它们\n\t\t- #GOLD#守护#LAST#变为#CRIMSON#血红守卫#LAST#：使用鲜血的力量控制并打倒那些敢于反抗你的愚民\n\t\t- #GOLD#十字军#LAST#变为#CRIMSON#无光之阳#LAST#：呼唤死星的力量来粉碎你的敌人\n\n\t\t你将学会以下的技能树：\n\t\t- #CRIMSON#血染#LAST#：让你的敌人血流成河！\n\t\t- #CRIMSON#背光面#LAST#：所有光明都会产生阴影，而你的尤其强大\n\t\t- #CRIMSON#憎恨#LAST#：将你的憎恨化为伤痕和鲜血\n\t\t- #CRIMSON#挽歌#LAST#：对悲伤和死亡的歌颂增强着你的信念\n\n\t\t你将遗忘以下技能树，并返还所有技能点：双手战技和盾牌攻击。\n\t\t同时你战斗技巧系的所有技能都将消耗仇恨而非体力。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8b3506153ae668b0d4447d5abee92132427f00f2f7a957482728ba7b56bd4a45","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1ad270171514d2210683df03392e5c8ac7ca89c950da278262c6935851889e27","logical_entry_identity":"92772f4be5c2517c8320618595fbb21bad80fc350e946487b8feacc7a3178f5d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The wild wild east","source_tag":"_t","target":"遥远的东方"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1fb437c6aea3b25e7d5f6fe536723cda725a6a217eec967121f4f0dac2ddc7c0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1ad675c07f8c13f716f94e92b00c3e8b38ed7c8a0f3931ef7e067a909d382d59","logical_entry_identity":"315e76931f1b90758078f756cd1db85509d5186d6cdf8ed9335bf18327d158f3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s calls forth a temporal warden from another timeline.","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s 从另一条时间线召唤出时空守卫。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"30fd17580a94683cbf6bcc494ca184891730cfebc29c316a96b4be23f1a2f458","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1ad7114c9b55c125166ae5e3abbd924a5165ba3401cd6b9291d194bb357d08c4","logical_entry_identity":"cbbbd9e3fa2c455d064f6798d4905a2779dc82a8afb1f64d06d91769f6c24a21","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"monolith","source_tag":"_t","target":"符文巨石"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"663e8147dd578b6a35b53c5c408aa7707e29f9c39a4a0e55c4ef2e59610852e0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1ad9f398251dc8300e7acb1a969897a55dd2145c6435133f80090f7816aef971","logical_entry_identity":"7392ff8